      "independent_solution": [
        "x-axis: v_0x = 0, a_x = 8.0, so x = 4t^2 = 16 m gives t = 2 s. y-axis at the same t: y = 10.0(2) + (1/2)(2.0)(2)^2 = 24 m.",
        "Velocity at t = 2 s: v_x = 8.0(2) = 16 m/s, v_y = 10.0 + 2.0(2) = 14 m/s; speed = sqrt(16^2 + 14^2) = sqrt(452) = 21.26 m/s."
      ],
      "independent_answer": "2 s, 24 m, 21.26 m/s",
      "official_answer": "2 s, 24 m, 21.26 m/s",
      "agrees": true,
      "numeric_check": "sqrt(16/(0.5*8.0))"
